the target language is: prolog.

the templates are:
    Gesellschaft wirksam gegründet holds for *a case*.
    Gesellschaftsvertrag notariell beurkundet holds for *a case*.
    Stammkapital mind 25000 € holds for *a case*.
    Eintragung ins Handelsregister holds for *a case*; open textured.
    Gesellschaftsvertrag notariell beurkundet would hold for *a case*; unknown.
    Stammkapital mind 25000 € would hold for *a case*; unknown.

the knowledge base r4_16_accept_include_on_leaf includes:

the text of the_rulemap is at "sources/accept-include-on-leaf.ruml".

Gesellschaft wirksam gegründet holds for a case if
    Gesellschaftsvertrag notariell beurkundet holds for the case
    and Stammkapital mind 25000 € holds for the case
    and Eintragung ins Handelsregister holds for the case.

Gesellschaftsvertrag notariell beurkundet holds for a case if
    Gesellschaftsvertrag notariell beurkundet would hold for the case.

Stammkapital mind 25000 € holds for a case if
    Stammkapital mind 25000 € would hold for the case.

scenario generated_1 is, as stated in "accept-include-on-leaf.ruml" at generated_1:
    % no data
    node_1 expects answers ["Gesellschaft wirksam gegründet holds for case 1"] and any unknowns.
    not_node_1 expects answers ["it is not the case that Gesellschaft wirksam gegründet holds for case 1"] and any unknowns.
    node_2 expects answers ["Gesellschaftsvertrag notariell beurkundet holds for case 1"] and any unknowns.
    not_node_2 expects answers ["it is not the case that Gesellschaftsvertrag notariell beurkundet holds for case 1"] and any unknowns.
    node_3 expects answers ["Stammkapital mind 25000 € holds for case 1"] and any unknowns.
    not_node_3 expects answers ["it is not the case that Stammkapital mind 25000 € holds for case 1"] and any unknowns.
    node_4 expects answers ["Eintragung ins Handelsregister holds for case 1"] and any unknowns.
    not_node_4 expects answers ["it is not the case that Eintragung ins Handelsregister holds for case 1"] and any unknowns.

query node_1 is:
    Gesellschaft wirksam gegründet holds for case 1.

query not_node_1 is:
    it is not the case that Gesellschaft wirksam gegründet holds for case 1.

query node_2 is:
